s decreased 37% from 1992 to 2006\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Death rates were calculated for workers aged > 16 years, using estimates of employed civilian workers from the BLS Current Population Survey\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"certain data are presented only for the period 2003--2006 because, in 2003, industry coding changed to the 2002 North American Industry Classification System\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Per 100,000 civilian workers aged >16 years.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}